        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Lauziu Na rianramei zau lo!",
            "Theilou nimei chingbut thang duangh tatna;",
            "Rianra nkhalou nimei mei makge,",
            "Rianra khaengmei Pu.",
            "",
            "He! Poubaomei rianra khalou nimei mak,",
            "Kalvary chingbut thang nzuan tatna;",
            "Meipui meina lungh rianrana,",
            "Kapma handat the.",
            "",
            "2. Theilou nimei ching guang tanga,",
            "Akumhni cho aPoubauhmei ti hei;",
            "Kaphai kaban hian binlou Kros rukhou,",
            "Houmumei nun rui.",
            "",
            "3. Zauna rianra mak khang makge.",
            "Hei di nthuknga theilou kanmei tei;",
            "Kazei nthanmei zei rui luangliam lou,",
            "Nangni guang zau lo.",
            "",
            "4. Poubaomei zei patlou khou rui,",
            "Kandihmei ta pap khou ru thuaklou the;",
            "Tingkao kai chaengmun tei laanlou kan the.",
            "Kamei nun guay khang."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
